\p{Čech nerve: the Čech nerve of \code{f : x → s} is \code{cosk₀} in augmented simplicial objects over \code{s}; its \code{n}-th term is a limit over the appropriate shape; it exists when the relevant limits do; it is unique up to contractible choice; it is functorial in \code{f} (→ \ref{dec-up-0007})}
\p{Named by: \ref{dec-up-0007}.}
\p{\em{Lean declaration(s):} none yet.}
